        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Siân Gibson, Peter Kay, Johnny Vegas, Nigel Havers, Una Stubbs, Griff Rhys Jones, Nina Wadia, Sheila Reid, Kevin Eldon\n- Works: Peter Kay's Car Share, Murder on the Blackpool Express, The Official BBC Children in Need Medley\n- Organizations: BAFTA, National Television Awards, BBC Children in Need\n- Topics: British sitcoms, acting, writing, comedy awards\n\nFacts:\n- Siân Gibson was born as Siân Foulkes on 15 July 1976 and is a Welsh actress and writer.\n- Siân Gibson is known for collaborating with Peter Kay, including starring in and co-writing the comedy series Peter Kay's Car Share.\n- In Peter Kay's Car Share, Peter Kay plays supermarket assistant manager John Redmond and Siân Gibson plays promotions rep Kayleigh Kitson as part of a company car share scheme.\n- Siân Gibson won the 2016 BAFTA TV Award for Best Scripted Comedy and the National Television Award for Best Comedy for Peter Kay's Car Share.\n- Murder on the Blackpool Express stars Johnny Vegas, Siân Gibson, Nigel Havers, Una Stubbs, Griff Rhys Jones, Nina Wadia, Sheila Reid, and Kevin Eldon.\n- The Official BBC Children in Need Medley is a single by Peter Kay's Animated All Star Band.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
